I promise you that.

853
00:50:17,780 --> 00:50:20,040
Oh, yes, they will! They know we're missing,

854
00:50:20,050 --> 00:50:22,110
and they have tracking dragons.

855
00:50:22,120 --> 00:50:24,620
If you so much as touch us, hiccup is gonna kick...

856
