Really, trust me.

858
00:50:28,650 --> 00:50:31,060
He's only the son of stoick the vast,

859
00:50:31,060 --> 00:50:33,060
his heir to the throne of berk,

860
00:50:33,060 --> 00:50:36,560
and the greatest dragon master this world has ever seen.

861
00:50:36,560 --> 00:50:38,600
"Dragon master"?

862
00:50:38,600 --> 00:50:40,660
I alone control

863
00:50:40,670 --> 00:50:42,270
the dragons.

864
00:50:42,270 --> 00:50:44,170
Nope, mm-mm. Sorry!

865
00:50:44,170 --> 00:50:47,510
And unless you let us go right now,

866
00:50:47,510 --> 00:50:50,040
he will blast through here on his night fury

867
00:50:50,040 --> 00:50:52,110
