868
00:50:52,110 --> 00:50:54,210
to splinters.

869
00:50:54,210 --> 00:50:55,680
Then they'll be crying like babies.

870
00:50:55,680 --> 00:50:57,250
Funny and beautiful.

871
00:50:57,250 --> 00:50:58,580
Good one, babe. Yeah.

872
00:50:58,580 --> 00:51:01,290
Like babies, they always cry.

873
00:51:01,290 --> 00:51:02,490
Real tiny ones.

874
00:51:02,490 --> 00:51:04,820
First there was one rider,

875
00:51:04,820 --> 00:51:07,490
And now all of berk?

876
00:51:07,490 --> 00:51:10,390
And you led them to me!

877
00:51:10,400 --> 00:51:13,160
Drago...!

878
00:51:13,170 --> 00:51:16,170
Stop all preparations!

879
00:51:16,170 --> 00:51:20,200
We must attack the dragon riders' nest at once!

880
00:51:20,210 --> 00:51:23,570
We will take down their Alpha.

881
00:51:23,580 --> 00:51:27,480
Then we will take berk!

882
00:51:28,710 --> 00:51:30,310
Drago!

883
00:51:30,320 --> 00:51:31,520
And get rid of him.

884
00:51:31,520 --> 00:51:34,590
Drago, please, I...

885
00:51:40,130 --> 00:51:42,090
Stormfly!

886
