No!

887
00:51:58,180 --> 00:52:00,310
Well, bud...

888
00:52:00,310 --> 00:52:03,410
We can't wait around for drago to attack this place.

889
00:52:03,420 --> 00:52:05,350
We've got to find him first.

890
00:52:12,530 --> 00:52:13,590
Let's go.

891
00:52:15,800 --> 00:52:17,500
Easy now.

892
00:52:17,500 --> 00:52:19,560
Are you kidding me? How did you get in here?

893
00:52:19,570 --> 00:52:21,130
The same way we're getting you out.

894
00:52:21,130 --> 00:52:22,830
- "We"? - All clear.

895
00:52:22,840 --> 00:52:24,300
Toothless, come. Uh, wait, uh, wait...

896
00:52:24,300 --> 00:52:26,470
Okay, uh, dad, there-there's something

897
00:52:26,470 --> 00:52:28,540
you need to know. - Yeah, yeah, tell me on the way.

898
00:52:28,540 --> 00:52:31,540
Well, this isn't an "On the way" Kind of update, actually.

899
00:52:31,540 --> 00:52:32,740
I've heard enough, hiccup.

900
00:52:32,750 --> 00:52:34,410
More-more of the earth-shattering

901
00:52:34,410 --> 00:52:35,580
development variety.

902
00:52:35,580 --> 00:52:37,210
Yeah, just add it to pile.

903
00:52:37,220 --> 00:52:38,820
Yeah, I, uh, uh,

904
00:52:38,820 --> 00:52:42,190
dad, unlike most surprises I spring on you,

905
