907
00:52:46,530 --> 00:52:48,490
So...

908
00:52:48,490 --> 00:52:50,360
Uh...

909
00:52:50,360 --> 00:52:53,530
You might want to take this one.

910
00:52:53,530 --> 00:52:55,330
