914
00:53:04,340 --> 00:53:06,440
Oh.

915
00:53:13,890 --> 00:53:17,660
I know what you're gonna say, stoick.

916
00:53:17,660 --> 00:53:19,920
How could I have done this?

917
00:53:21,390 --> 00:53:23,430
Stayed away all of these years,

918
00:53:23,430 --> 00:53:25,500
