919
00:53:25,500 --> 00:53:27,460
To our son?

920
00:53:27,470 --> 00:53:28,730
Well...

921
00:53:28,730 --> 00:53:30,670
What sign did I have

922
00:53:30,670 --> 00:53:32,400
