945
00:54:54,750 --> 00:54:56,950
Please, ladies first.

946
00:54:56,960 --> 00:55:00,460
You are a steaming heap

947
00:55:00,460 --> 00:55:01,730
of dragon... - Duck.

948
00:55:05,930 --> 00:55:08,730
