Oh, pathetic.

952
00:55:22,420 --> 00:55:23,650
You can still jump.

953
00:55:23,650 --> 00:55:25,420
So, are we going to save your dragons

954
00:55:25,420 --> 00:55:27,450
and get out of here or not? - Mm.

955
00:55:27,450 --> 00:55:28,950
Check every trap.

956
00:55:28,950 --> 00:55:30,920
They're here somewhere.

957
00:55:39,860 --> 00:55:41,430
Meatlug?

958
00:55:42,700 --> 00:55:44,640
Anyone coming?

959
00:55:44,640 --> 00:55:46,500
I don't know, you just keep doing what you're doing.

960
00:55:46,510 --> 00:55:49,370
Keep cranking.

961
00:56:05,720 --> 00:56:08,960
