969
00:56:27,080 --> 00:56:29,380
Aye, your son's changed berk for the better.

970
00:56:29,380 --> 00:56:31,450
I think we did well with this one, val.

971
00:56:31,450 --> 00:56:32,620
Thanks, dad.

972
00:56:33,720 --> 00:56:35,450
Stoick : I got it.

973
00:56:35,450 --> 00:56:36,590
I got it.

974
