Remember our song, val?

990
00:57:44,190 --> 00:57:47,690
I'll swim and sail

991
00:57:47,690 --> 00:57:51,830
On savage seas

992
00:57:51,830 --> 00:57:56,900
With ne'er a fear of drowning

993
00:57:56,900 --> 00:58:00,770
And gladly ride

994
00:58:00,770 --> 00:58:03,240
The waves of life

995
00:58:05,240 --> 00:58:09,480
If you will marry me

996
00:58:11,850 --> 00:58:14,520
No scorching sun

997
00:58:14,520 --> 00:58:17,190
Nor freezing cold

998
00:58:17,190 --> 00:58:19,060
Will stop...

999
00:58:19,060 --> 00:58:20,890
Will stop me on my jour...

1000
00:58:20,890 --> 00:58:22,060
...ney.

1001
00:58:22,060 --> 00:58:23,760
sorry.

1002
00:58:26,600 --> 00:58:28,670
If you will promise me

1003
00:58:28,670 --> 00:58:33,100
Your heart

1004
00:58:35,910 --> 00:58:38,580
And love...

1005
