And love me for eternity

1006
00:58:50,220 --> 00:58:53,760
My dearest one

1007
00:58:53,760 --> 00:58:55,730
My darling dear

1008
00:58:55,730 --> 00:58:56,930
Your mighty words

1009
00:58:56,930 --> 00:58:59,900
Astound me

1010
