From all harm if you would stay beside me

1016
00:59:17,220 --> 00:59:20,050
I have no use for rings of gold

1017
00:59:20,050 --> 00:59:21,790
I care not for your poetry

1018
00:59:21,790 --> 00:59:23,920
I only want your hand to hold

1019
00:59:23,920 --> 00:59:25,860
I only want you near me

1020
00:59:25,860 --> 00:59:27,790
To love and kiss, to sweetly hold

1021
00:59:27,790 --> 00:59:30,130
hey!  For the dancing and the dreaming

1022
