And your lights, I'll keep your laugh inside me

1024
00:59:34,170 --> 00:59:35,770
I'll swim and sail the savage seas

1025
00:59:35,770 --> 00:59:38,200
With ne'er a fear of drowning

1026
00:59:38,200 --> 00:59:40,070
And gladly ride the waves of life

1027
00:59:40,070 --> 00:59:41,910
If you will marry me!

1028
00:59:43,680 --> 00:59:45,180
I'm still going...

1029
00:59:45,180 --> 00:59:46,580
gobber...

1030
