1053
01:01:12,970 --> 01:01:15,300
Aye, you got it. Come on, son!

1054
01:01:22,710 --> 01:01:24,340
Reload!

1055
01:01:24,340 --> 01:01:25,910
Fire!

1056
01:01:30,780 --> 01:01:32,920
