Eret, son of eret!

1072
01:02:47,930 --> 01:02:49,790
Aah...!

1073
01:02:59,200 --> 01:03:00,770
up, girl!

1074
01:03:00,770 --> 01:03:02,010
Lean left, eret!

1075
