I watched you burn!

1107
01:06:05,990 --> 01:06:08,330
It takes more than a little fire to kill me!

1108
01:06:31,080 --> 01:06:32,380
Stoick!

1109
01:06:52,770 --> 01:06:54,170
No!

1110
01:06:56,240 --> 01:06:58,070
No!

1111
01:07:19,060 --> 01:07:20,460
